meta {
  name: Get Order
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/orders/{{order_id}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Get Order

  Returns the full order with city, category, assigned master (when set),
  photos and tasks (before/after WebP). This is the order card screen — one
  snapshot of everything about the job.

  When order status is `assigned` or `in_progress`, `master.location` contains
  the master's latest GPS ping (`lat`, `lng`, `recorded_at`). For all other
  statuses `master.location` is `null`.

  For the map itself — the full trail, the destination and the `is_active`
  flag — use **10_realtime → Order Track** instead. This endpoint carries only
  the single latest ping.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "status": "assigned",
      "status_label": "Назначен мастер",
      "description": "Кран в ванной течёт",
      "client_address": "ул. Атамырата Ниязова, д. 42",
      "client_lat": "37.9382000",
      "client_lng": "58.3833000",
      "final_price": null,
      "city": { "id": 5, "name": "Ашхабад" },
      "category": { "id": 2, "name": "Сантехника" },
      "master": {
        "id": 11,
        "name": "Aydogdy Ussadow",
        "phone": "+99362111222",
        "location": {
          "lat": 37.9364,
          "lng": 58.3795,
          "recorded_at": "2026-06-15 14:32:00"
        }
      },
      "photos": [
        { "id": 1, "url": "https://...", "status": "done" }
      ],
      "tasks": [],
      "review": null,
      "assigned_at": "2026-05-16 10:05:00",
      "started_at": null,
      "completed_at": null,
      "cancelled_at": null,
      "created_at": "2026-05-16 10:00:00"
    }
  }
  ```

  `client_lat` / `client_lng` come back as strings (decimal cast); dates use
  `Y-m-d H:i:s` here, unlike the ISO-8601 dates on the master side.

  **Errors:**
  - `404` — order not found or does not belong to this client
  - `401` — missing / invalid token
}
